  "It maps the entire sky again and again in infrared light. Compare two of its maps and anything in our Solar System has moved. That is the idea behind this whole site.": "Ia memetakan seluruh langit berulang kali dalam cahaya inframerah. Bandingkan dua petanya dan apa sahaja dalam Sistem Suria kita telah bergerak. Itulah idea di sebalik seluruh laman ini.",
